{"c":"431030","n":"MŽE 7","t":"M","s":"ZČ","o":"Tachov","url":"431030-mze-7","stav":"2026-10-04","popis":"GPS Z: 49°48'42.911\"N, 12°45'51.055\"E, K: 49°47'35.335\"N, 12°39'21.674\"E\nPřítok Berounky. Od jezu v k. ú. Ústí (ř. km 78,9) až k mostu u čistírny odpadních vod v Tachově (ř. km 90,9). Dále část Brtného potoka (GPS Z: 49°47'38.667\"N, 12°39'49.553\"E, K: 49°47'12.65\"N, 12°39'49.705\"E)\nod vtoku do Mže v Oldřichově (ř. km 88,3) až po hráz rybníka Štrambád u Malého Rapotína (ř. km 2,0), odtud je potok součástí samostatného pstruhového revíru. Štika obecná nemá na řece a potoce stanovenu zákonnou míru a ulovené štiky nesmějí být vráceny zpět do vody.","delka":12,"rozloha":14,"lat":49.799383,"lon":12.7101,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/tachov","mo_tel":"602 201 130","mo_mail":"mocrs.tachov@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-0